        <p class="chapter-label">ABOUT ME · VAN-PHUC BUI</p>
        <h1>I work on satellite 5G. <em>And I still return to the fundamentals.</em></h1>
        <p class="about-lead">
          I'm Van-Phuc Bui, a wireless communications engineer based in Aalborg, Denmark.
          I currently develop software for satellite-based 5G NR. Before that, I spent several
          years researching wireless systems, satellite networks and directions for future 6G.
        </p>
        <p>
          Even after years of studying and working in this field, I sometimes ask:
          do I really understand FFT, in-phase and quadrature components, OFDM and channel estimation from first principles,
          or have I just become comfortable using them? That question is why I started VietWireless.
        </p>
